              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "appōnō, appōnere — \"to serve up, to put before\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Servī cēnam amīcīs appōnēbant. The slaves were serving dinner to the friends."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "appōnō, appōnere, apposuī, appositum: ad + pōnō (taught), to set food before someone."
            }
          ]
        },
