            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To season? (condiō, condīre.) A seasoning? (condīmentum, condīmentī.) To sprinkle? (aspergō, aspergere.) To pour in? (īnfundō, īnfundere.) To strain? (cōlō, cōlāre.) To serve up? (appōnō, appōnere.) To wait at table? (ministrō, ministrāre.) A dining room? (triclīnium, triclīniī.) To recline at table? (discumbō, discumbere.) A course? (ferculum, ferculī.)"
